### GET all rooms (success)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### GET all rooms with filters (success)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?minCapacity=5&keyword=Room

### GET room by ID (success)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1

### GET room by ID (failure - not found 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99

### POST create room (success)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "New Room", "capacity": 15 }

### POST create room (failure - 400 capacity > 20)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Big Room", "capacity": 25 }

### PUT update room (success)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Updated Pod", "capacity": 5 }

### PUT update room (failure - 400 capacity < 1)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Small Pod", "capacity": 0 }

### PUT update room (failure - not found 404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Missing Room", "capacity": 10 }

### DELETE room (success)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/3

### DELETE room (failure - not found 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99
